      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "'Troops' — a section heading carrying no value of its own. It opens the military block that follows to its left (步兵, 砲兵, 大砲, 小銃), all still 新發田藩's since all of it stands right of the ○島原藩 marker."
