  {
    "id": "anno-shibata_lower_p083_left-12",
    "type": "Annotation",
    "body": [
      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "步兵 三大隊 一小隊六十人 八小隊ヲ以テ一大隊トナス"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "歩兵（ほへい） 三大隊　一小隊六十人、八小隊をもって一大隊となす"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Infantry: 3 battalions. The warichu (double-column note) beneath defines the establishment — read the RIGHT sub-run first ('one platoon is 60 men'), then the LEFT ('eight platoons make one battalion'). The strength therefore computes as 3 × 8 × 60 = 1,440 foot soldiers. The note matters: the headline figure is 3 battalions, and only the gloss converts it into men."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "步兵"
      }
    ],
    "target": {
      "source": "images/lower_p083_left.jpg",
      "selector": {
        "type": "FragmentSelector",
        "conformsTo": "http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/",
        "value": "xywh=pixel:1785,1196,121,1315"
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "anno-shibata_lower_p083_left-13",
    "type": "Annotation",
    "body": [
      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "砲兵 二百人 但各砲大小有之 人員不一"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "砲兵（ほうへい） 二百人　但し各砲大小これ有り、人員一ならず"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Artillerymen: 200. The warichu qualifies the figure — RIGHT sub-run: 'however, the guns vary in calibre'; LEFT sub-run: 'so the crew size is not uniform.' The 200 is thus a total headcount, not a per-gun establishment that could be multiplied against the 24 cannon."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "砲兵"
      }
    ],
    "target": {
      "source": "images/lower_p083_left.jpg",
      "selector": {
        "type": "FragmentSelector",
        "conformsTo": "http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/",
