  {
    "id": "anno-shibata_lower_p083_left-15",
    "type": "Annotation",
    "body": [
      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "小銃 二千挺"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "小銃（しょうじゅう） 二千挺"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Small arms: 2,000 (挺 is the counter for firearms). The 千 carries the diagonal stroke on top that separates it from 十 — confirmed side by side against the 十 of 大砲 二十四門 at the same height, which forecloses the ×100 misread."
      },
      {
